WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.730
- You grew up in a suburb

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.160
on the south side of Chicago.

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:04.770
How do you think that affected you

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:05.900
during this time?

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.900
- I grew up in a suburb

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.050
and there is all the difference.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.879
And had I grown up in
the south side of Chicago

00:00:09.879 --> 00:00:12.290
where both of my parents
worked, the actual city

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.319
my experience would have
been a lot different.

00:00:14.319 --> 00:00:16.730
But as I was in a suburb,
it was a new suburb,

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:18.900
it was the Manifest Destiny of people

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.860
who lived in Chicago to go south

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:22.870
and to create these suburbs

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.519
and we were the original settlers

00:00:25.519 --> 00:00:27.720
(laughing)
of Dolton, Illinois in 1960.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:32.250
And we were, I wasn't even
aware of the Vietnam War

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:36.580
and I was 10 in 1970, so
you think I would have.

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:38.070
I kind of vaguely heard about it.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.920
My parents didn't talk about
it at the dinner table.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.710
I wasn't aware of anything going on.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:45.580
And it wasn't until I moved
out here to Los Angeles,

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:47.000
I live in Laurel Canyon,

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.390
and I became familiar
with what went on here

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:51.410
like musically and politically

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:53.230
and the time I was growing up

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:54.220
and I had no idea.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.910
So, I was in kind of a bubble.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:01:01.530
And I think being gay

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:06.530
you kind of, you have to
get out of your comfort.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:09.600
I think that that just demands

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.060
that you step away from where it's safe

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:14.730
because you can't fully express yourself

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:15.563
if you stay there.

00:01:15.563 --> 00:01:18.950
So, I was, after college
I went to the city

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:21.920
and learned a lot more.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:24.610
And what compelled me to move to the city

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:26.980
was the fact that I
probably couldn't be gay

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:28.100
in Dolton, Illinois, open.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.090
But I could be in the city.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:33.250
So, I just dove right into
it and I learned a lot.

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:34.790
- I mean, that's a whole other thing, too.

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:37.633
Just, and you mentioned
in Marvelous Mrs. Maisel

00:01:37.633 --> 00:01:40.000
even being a woman that
can be very difficult.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.320
Being gay can be difficult.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:44.350
It's all those, it's
like if you think of...

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:46.440
I think sometimes people aren't impacted

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:48.128
unless it directly impacts you.

00:01:48.128 --> 00:01:48.961
- Yeah, yeah.
- So you just

00:01:48.961 --> 00:01:50.330
have to rephrase it.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.680
Being gay in a place that
that's not generally acceptable

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:56.989
or people are fearful of
it or just don't know it

00:01:56.989 --> 00:01:59.480
that's a whole, that's
the same kind of thing

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:02.740
in a sense of not feeling
safe to be yourself

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:04.410
not feeling safe outside of your home.

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:06.188
You had to move to a different place.

00:02:06.188 --> 00:02:07.820
That's ridiculous.

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:10.193
Like, all of that is insane to me.

00:02:10.193 --> 00:02:11.026
- Yeah.

00:02:11.026 --> 00:02:12.170
- And I just thank you

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:15.933
'cause I actually do see
you on Twitter quite a bit.

